    "en": {
      "title": "Piling",
      "h1": "MR-P / Piling",
      "description": "MR-P is Marini’s series of compact and powerful piling rigs, designed to deliver precision and efficiency in demanding projects. These rigs, which work with…",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "Marini – logo",
          "href": "/produkter/marini",
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1117,
          "src": "/assets/img/marini-3.webp"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "MR-P / Piling – image 2",
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1752,
          "src": "/assets/img/marini-palning-2.webp"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "MR-P is Marini’s series of compact and powerful piling rigs, designed to deliver precision and efficiency in demanding projects. These rigs, which work with Kelly-bar systems and augers, are known for their versatility and robust performance. With drilling depths ranging from 18 metres to 32 metres and a maximum drilling diameter of up to 1,300 mm, the MR-P series is perfect for different types of ground conditions and projects."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "With engines of up to 103 kW and a rotation speed of up to 90 rpm, the MR-P combines high capacity with easy handling."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "The rigs are compact, which makes them easy to transport and use at different worksites, while offering impressive pull and push forces for stable deep drilling. In addition to the Kelly-bar system (marked BP – bored piles), the series also includes CFA models (Continuous Flight Auger), which provide even greater flexibility for different drilling applications."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "<a href=\"/kontakta-oss\">Contact us</a> for more information."
        },
        {
